Description: Comprehensive estimation and inference methods for conditional expected shortfall 
        regression under a variety of settings, based on the two-step regression framework developed in 
        <doi:10.1093/jjfinec/nbag003>. The package covers linear expected shortfall regression, 
        high-dimensional expected shortfall regression 
        (<doi:10.1080/01621459.2024.2448860>), 
        robust expected shortfall regression for heavy-tailed responses 
        (<doi:10.1093/jrsssb/qkad063>), 
        and autoregressive expected shortfall models for dynamic time series.
